<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/5/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The issue is authorised of a sum not exceeding fourteen billion eight hundred and ninety-three million eight hundred and thirty-nine thousand and two hundred and ninety-four ringgit (RM14,893,839,294) from the Consolidated Fund for expenditure on the services specified in the Schedule for the seryice of the year 1995, not provided for or not fully provided for by the Supply Act 1995, the Supplementary Supply (1994 and 1995) Act 1995, the Supplementary Supply (1995) Act 1995 and the Supplementary Supply (1995) Act 1996."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/5/eng@> .
